World "Spacetime"
Title "Minkowski Spacetime"


Introduction "Welcome to the Spacetime World or Minkowski Spacetime if you're getting into the physics mood! The last one currently available in the game. Here we combine `MySpace` and `MyTime` into the four dimensional vector `MySpacetime`.

You might be thinking that since this is a whole new type you're have to prove all the theorems from Space World again. But worry not, we've done it for you, including porting over `simp_vector`.

Just like how `MyTime` carries a `timeCharacter`, `MySpacetime` carries a `causalCharacter` but we'll see that later. Firstly we'll give bilinear products their rightful place in spacetime by defining a Minkowski Product, if you're interested in learning about why Minkowski keeps popping up don't be afraid to look him up! Pretty interesting guy.
"
